=== Tournament-analysis lens ranking ===
vertices: lens, explained_AP, monotonicity, remaining_residual, formal_tail_cost
  m=1_lead             (3, 3, 1, 1)
  same_frequency_tail  (3, 3, 1, 2)
  hidden_fold_shape    (2, 2, 3, 3)
  support_cycle_tail   (1, 1, 3, 4)
Hamiltonian path: m=1_lead -> same_frequency_tail -> hidden_fold_shape -> support_cycle_tail
challenged assumption: additive energy alone is not enough; shifted/hidden-fold rows keep shape data.

Interpretation:
  The same-frequency additive-energy packet is positive for k=8..13 with a tiny explicit
  1/m^4 tail after H=12.  It strengthens the KPS m=1 monotonicity signal.
  However, AP residuals after this packet are not zero; the remaining proof obligation
  lives in hidden-fold / support-cycle shape terms, not in scalar additive energy alone.
